#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Aither R8-CONTROL corrected preflight (Qwen3.8 control).

Fixes the R7-C1 measurement-infrastructure defects found by the R8 audit:

  D1  schema_valid was a hardcoded constant -> now REAL JSON Schema validation
      (jsonschema) of every tool-call argument against the canonical tool schema.
  D2  expected-tool match was ">=1 tool call, all known" -> now EXACT expected-tool
      matching (PASS only when the required tool name is actually called).
  D3  multi-tool was scored PASS on a single call -> now requires >=2 distinct
      required actions, each valid + schema-valid.
  D4  "multi-turn" was a single prompt -> now a true
      assistant -> tool result -> assistant continuation sequence.
  D5  "error recovery" was not exercised -> now true injected failures with a
      controlled error result and a recovery check.
  D6  negative controls were not separated -> now separated and NOT counted in
      expected-tool-case totals.
  D7  no raw request/response ledger -> now a full JSONL ledger.

This script MUST NOT alter R7-C1 scenario semantics. It is a preflight of basic
tool-calling capability against the production Qwen3.8 control model.

Outputs (paths resolved relative to script dir unless absolute):
  <outdir>/AITHER_R8_CONTROL_QWEN38_PREFLIGHT.csv
  <outdir>/AITHER_R8_CONTROL_QWEN38_PREFLIGHT_RAW.jsonl
"""
